WEBVTT

00:00:14.057 --> 00:00:15.934
[sad music playing]

00:00:19.479 --> 00:00:20.605
[Wolf sighs]

00:00:25.402 --> 00:00:27.946
[huffs] So much for Piranha Street.

00:00:36.246 --> 00:00:37.455
[groans]

00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:41.626
[brakes screech]

00:00:43.002 --> 00:00:45.004
[all groaning]

00:00:47.006 --> 00:00:48.049
Chief?

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:51.928
Okay, let's say, hypothetically,
I believe you-- Which I don't!

00:00:52.011 --> 00:00:53.096
But if I did...

00:00:53.179 --> 00:00:57.267
If I did and some super criminal
has a gold magnet,

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:58.518
how would we stop them?

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:00.937
You-- You believe us?

00:01:01.521 --> 00:01:02.522
[groans]

00:01:03.857 --> 00:01:05.859
[hopeful music playing]

00:01:07.527 --> 00:01:09.779
-[Snake laughs]
-No! No, no, no. No!

00:01:09.863 --> 00:01:10.905
[Bad Guys laughing]

00:01:10.989 --> 00:01:12.407
[Tarantula] I wanna give her a hug.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:14.033
[Shark] Ooh, I like Chief.

00:01:14.117 --> 00:01:15.618
[Piranha] Chief, is that a new shampoo?

00:01:15.702 --> 00:01:16.828
Okay, okay.

00:01:16.911 --> 00:01:18.496
Please, stop with the touching.

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:19.789
I don't get you guys.

00:01:19.873 --> 00:01:23.293
You're good, then you're bad,
then you're sort of good, then really bad.

00:01:23.376 --> 00:01:24.502
[groans] It's hard to keep up!

00:01:24.586 --> 00:01:27.547
Yep, yep. That's fair. [laughs]

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:29.674
I get it. We're all over the place.

00:01:29.757 --> 00:01:32.427
But you need to get us to that rocket
before it takes off.

00:01:33.011 --> 00:01:34.804
Rocket? What-- What are you talking about?

00:01:36.347 --> 00:01:38.975
Initiating backwards counting.

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:41.060
[computer] Countdown initiated.

00:01:41.144 --> 00:01:43.688
Countdown initiated?
Whoa. What's going on?

00:01:43.771 --> 00:01:44.772
I don't know.

00:01:44.856 --> 00:01:46.441
Well, shut it down, Jenny! Shut it down!

00:01:46.524 --> 00:01:47.859
I'm trying, Jim!

00:01:47.942 --> 00:01:50.820
Uh, Mr. Moon?
We've got a slight situation.

00:01:50.904 --> 00:01:52.489
The launch isn't until next week--

00:01:52.572 --> 00:01:54.574
-[rocket booms]
-[alarm blaring]

00:01:55.617 --> 00:01:58.995
Well, butter my crumpets.

00:02:07.712 --> 00:02:11.925
-[computer] Five, four, three...
-[technician] Evacuate!

00:02:12.008 --> 00:02:14.052
<i>...two... one.</i>

00:02:26.856 --> 00:02:28.775
Whoo-hoo!

00:02:31.903 --> 00:02:33.696
[reporter] The twists just keep coming.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:37.158
The MoonX rocket seems to have
taken off three days early--

00:02:37.242 --> 00:02:38.243
Huh?

00:02:38.743 --> 00:02:40.286
What the hairbrush?

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.412
[thrilling music playing]

00:02:41.496 --> 00:02:43.289
[screaming]

00:02:43.373 --> 00:02:44.916
Yeah! [laughs]

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:48.795
Uh-oh.

00:02:48.878 --> 00:02:49.879
Bring it on!

00:02:50.505 --> 00:02:51.881
[Bad Guys shouting]

00:02:52.465 --> 00:02:53.800
[alarms blaring]

00:02:53.883 --> 00:02:55.635
-[Bad Guys screaming]
-[Luggins laughing]

00:03:08.398 --> 00:03:09.774
Holy moly!

00:03:12.694 --> 00:03:14.487
Are you sure about this?

00:03:14.571 --> 00:03:16.864
Not particularly. No.

00:03:16.948 --> 00:03:20.368
Remember, when you come back,
you're under arrest!

00:03:21.578 --> 00:03:22.620
You got it...

00:03:23.246 --> 00:03:24.247
Commissioner.

00:03:25.999 --> 00:03:27.500
Go get 'em, guys!

00:03:30.753 --> 00:03:32.213
All right, here we go.

00:03:32.297 --> 00:03:34.007
First time for everything, right?

00:03:35.592 --> 00:03:37.594
[all screaming]

00:03:52.108 --> 00:03:53.109
[thruster booms]

00:03:56.696 --> 00:03:59.824
-Run, run, run. Let's go!
-Come on! Go! Go! Go!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.625
-Let's go, go, go!
-Guys, come on! Move, move, move!

00:04:10.835 --> 00:04:12.170
We did it!

00:04:12.253 --> 00:04:13.338
-We did it! We did it!
-Yeah!

00:04:13.421 --> 00:04:14.422
[Wolf] We did it!

00:04:16.007 --> 00:04:17.050
[Piranha] We didn't do it!

00:04:18.092 --> 00:04:19.135
Jump!

00:04:19.218 --> 00:04:21.220
[epic music playing]

00:04:29.479 --> 00:04:30.480
[grunts]

00:04:31.939 --> 00:04:33.107
Pull us up, Snake.

00:04:33.733 --> 00:04:36.778
Vinyasa, baby!

00:04:39.155 --> 00:04:41.449
Up there! The cargo bay!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.882
Pull!

00:04:57.965 --> 00:05:00.301
Come on! Pull! Pull!

00:05:00.385 --> 00:05:01.969
Are you kidding me?

00:05:02.053 --> 00:05:03.888
Lefty-loosey, righty-tighty.

00:05:05.932 --> 00:05:07.892
Oh. Right!

00:05:08.476 --> 00:05:10.019
-[alarm blaring]
-What is it?

00:05:13.481 --> 00:05:14.482
[alarm stops]

00:05:14.565 --> 00:05:16.693
Eh. Never mind. Just glitch.

00:05:20.154 --> 00:05:21.155
Whoa.

00:05:21.656 --> 00:05:23.700
[majestic music playing]

00:05:23.783 --> 00:05:25.952
[Kitty] Now that is a view.

00:05:32.959 --> 00:05:34.752
What is happening?

00:05:34.836 --> 00:05:37.630
[choking] Sir, they're heading
to the Multinational Space Station.

00:05:37.714 --> 00:05:38.923
I think they're docking.

00:05:56.149 --> 00:05:57.775
-[Kitty] Doom, you're with me.
-[groans]

00:05:59.569 --> 00:06:01.738
Pigtail, get the MacGuffinite in place.

00:06:03.489 --> 00:06:05.158
You got it, Kitty.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:13.124
Yoo-hoo! Anybody home? [laughs]

00:06:19.547 --> 00:06:23.634
Oh, nice decor. Very, uh, "space-y."

00:06:23.718 --> 00:06:24.761
[laughs]

00:06:28.222 --> 00:06:31.350
In hindsight, that was a little reckless.

00:06:31.434 --> 00:06:33.019
Did everybody make it?

00:06:33.102 --> 00:06:34.687
Hey, where's Piranha?

00:06:34.771 --> 00:06:36.397
Whoo!

00:06:36.481 --> 00:06:39.150
I can fly! [laughs]

00:06:39.233 --> 00:06:41.903
I just needed to believe in myself! Ha!

00:06:41.986 --> 00:06:43.446
Whoa.

00:06:43.529 --> 00:06:45.740
-Whoa. Oh.
-[laughs]

00:06:45.823 --> 00:06:48.075
Oh, y-you guys can fly too?

00:06:48.951 --> 00:06:50.578
[all laughing]

00:06:51.078 --> 00:06:52.789
All right, watch the legs!

00:06:52.872 --> 00:06:54.999
Whoa. Guys! Check this out!

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.585
[Piranha] What is she doing?

00:06:57.668 --> 00:07:00.087
[welding]

00:07:09.806 --> 00:07:12.600
They're using the MoonX Power Cell
to activate the MacGuffinite.

00:07:14.894 --> 00:07:16.062
Kinda genius.

00:07:21.776 --> 00:07:23.236
Yeah, they're smart.

00:07:23.319 --> 00:07:25.446
But there's something
they didn't count on.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.366
I got a plan.

00:07:32.662 --> 00:07:34.330
Installation complete.

00:07:34.956 --> 00:07:36.499
Confirming coordinates.

